という高度な隠密技術の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"植物を操る “木遁の術” の使い手であり、戦闘時は掌から強力な薔薇の鞭を出現させて戦う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖艶な魅力で男性を魅了するのも、潜入任務では欠かせない才能の一つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし過剰に性衝動を誘発させる豊満すぎる乳房とお尻が悩みの種でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"＜忍法・花散る乱＞"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"木遁系の忍法。 毒を含んだ花びらの嵐が吹き荒れ、周囲の者を毒で冒し昏倒させる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"植物が作り出す毒物であれば何でも花びらに含ませることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この学園には何かがあるわ。 ん～、そうね。女の勘ってやつよ♪」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32359"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"171 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6209","sourceWorkId":"21248","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/359e3d8806d0b20dcbd4b39783d6c4c2ff56594a049bcfa0c200fe16a8766270.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23807f6cdcef78e963e71e1d8e2aa62eac849fa8d60a364ec9b7b83f8a300ce0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"眞田朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s610","name":"眞田 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126046:32359:5928:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6812","characterName":"八津 紫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89550","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"259337"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14292"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6812"},"originalCharacterName":"八津 紫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"508"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","v